{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：05:26 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：05:26 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：05:26 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e9da14fb1ace4102e270a8e7fa593ae/2026-10/2026-10-29_21_22_33.png\"/><p>大圍秦石邨一名男子被發現倒斃住所。29日晚上約11時，一名35歲姓李男子與家人失去聯絡，家人擔心他在石玉樓住所內暈倒，遂報案求助。</p><p>救護人員接報到場，發現李男倒臥單位內，經檢查證實已死亡。事件原因仍有待調查，確實死因須經驗屍確定。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T21:40:52.487348+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T21:26:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T00:58:37.593962+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T21:38:20.833536+00:00","content_hash":"ed198b4b1d7d5c99528923b5211360521b7db3c5a8ca14767e75da828cbcbe89","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}